    "ROOT issues a separate actual admission with schema ROOT_NATIVE_CONTEXT_SEARCH_V3_SINGLE_EXPOSED_TASK_ADMISSION_V1, status ADMITTED_ONE_EXPOSED_0055_AVAILABLE_NODE_V3_TOKENIZER_ONLY, execution_authorized true, and the exact fixed fields in this proposal; bind source_copy_ref, adapter_controls_ref, clock_ref and exact_driver_source_ref. This inactive proposal cannot be used as the admission.",
