    "Charge all newly written source/result/log/partial/receipt bytes within the QA tree plus the full 2097152-byte outside-tree capture and source-free-control receipt reservation to the original output carry. The QA tree, including its source copies, must stay within 8388608 bytes. The source-copy cap is nested inside that tree cap and does not create another output allowance.",
